# TripPilot Project Brain

TripPilot is a travel budget planning app that helps users plan trip budgets, track expenses, manage itineraries, and optimize spending across destinations. Julio is the Product Lead and developer.

## Before answering about TripPilot, read the relevant files in TripPilot/brain/:

- `TripPilot/brain/README.md` — Entry point with truth policy and file index
- `TripPilot/brain/product-spec.md` — Features, rules, scope
- `TripPilot/brain/decision-log.md` — All decisions with status
- `TripPilot/brain/technical-direction.md` — Stack, database, auth, infra
- `TripPilot/brain/implementation-phases.md` — Phases ordered by importance
- `TripPilot/brain/project-status.md` — Current status, pending tasks, next steps
- `TripPilot/brain/competitive-landscape.md` — Competitor analysis
- `TripPilot/brain/meetings-log.md` — Meeting decisions and action items

## Critical rules — NEVER contradict these:

- Brain files are the SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for product decisions
- If a decision is not in decision-log.md, it has NOT been made
- The AI must READ brain files before answering product questions
- Code output must always be in English (variable names, comments, etc.)
- Documents follow the language of the request

